WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
What gets through when you are trying not to listen?

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.000
Researchers asked listeners to follow one voice and ignore another.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.500
A person's name sometimes appeared in the ignored message.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:26.000
Not everyone noticed. In one study, about a third did.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:33.000
Those who noticed could make more errors in the task they were following.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Twelve-minute audio is a format, not proof of an hour of benefits.
